        <mxCell id="qIKOtIIX6tGNIJb34SZi-133" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;At rename time, we need to read and write into the FRM.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;At Issue time we need to read sources from the PRF. (throughput should accomodate 2 src per each RS entry: huge)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;At Writeback time we need to write into the PRF. (throughput should accomodate 1 dst per RS: high)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;At commit time we need to write into the BRM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;We need to use a Register Read Request Buffer and a Register Write Request Buffer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-975" y="-190" width="365" height="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qIKOtIIX6tGNIJb34SZi-134" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;When we do the lookup in the PRF, we will get back the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;DS map. Using this we select the instr. dest reg and also all the uops dest/src regs. Then we must send a write back request on the map :). This means a significant pressure on the PRF, and also implies a large number of registers to not stall.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;The DS Map is updated at rename time, but it is also updated at Issue time, when source values are moved to the execution unit.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1470" y="420" width="320" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1tE3-SvhsdAM9JEqb4TX-3" value="instr" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1270" y="210" width="120" height="20" as="geometry" />
